# A rule the real code breaks today. `run.sh` reports it and stays green; it
# fails once the rule holds, so the finding then moves into ScreenShareLease.cfg.
# Format: <rule><TAB><finding>
AtMostOneShare	A second participant can start a screen share while the first one still runs, because the 10 s lease is not renewed by an unchanged observation
ReshareGetsFullLease	A failed lease release is ignored, so the same participant's next share inherits the old lease and its remaining hard cap
